{"meta":{"id":"tt0831888","type":"movie","name":"En defensa de la Ciudad Tesoro","imdb_id":"tt0831888","description":"En la Ciudad Tesoro, donde la Luna sonríe y los niños pueden volar, la vida puede ser tan maravillosa como terrible. Negro y Blanco, dos huérfanos que se buscan la vida como pueden, divisan la ciudad como halcones y no paran de meterse en líos. Su reinado en las alturas tocará a su fin cuando aparezca un grupo de mafiosos. La ciudad está en peligro, y Negro y Blanco están dispuestos a acudir al rescate, aunque tengan que enfrentarse a la yakuza y sus \"aliens asesinos\".","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0831888.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iAlJWcoEqKTmfxVMQ6pDyizPRsK.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/49LlkIWOuKNXMZAj72PPhxSY5sD.png","genres":["Animación","Acción","Aventura"],"releaseInfo":"2006","released":"2006-12-23T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"103 min","imdbRating":"7.5","country":"Japan","cast":["Kazunari Ninomiya","伊勢谷友介","蒼井優","宮藤官九郎","田中泯","納谷六朗","西村知道","麦人","大森南朋","岡田義徳","黒沢かずこ","村上知子","大島美幸","環有希","山口眞弓","浅井晴美","Atsushi Imaizumi","Bryan Burton-Lewis","奈良徹","Shunsuke Mizutani","Tatsuhiro Fukiage","Hiroto Nakajima","Hiroshi Shibata","Seiichi Yoneoka","Yûji Matsumaru","Masayuki Furuya","Toshiya Matsushita","本木雅弘","Mai Ito","千葉優輝"],"director":["Michael Arias"],"writer":["松本大洋","Anthony Weintraub","Michael Arias","田中栄子"],"trailers":[{"source":"VujRQ8vt-m8","type":"Trailer","name":"Official English Trailer","ytId":"VujRQ8vt-m8","lang":"en"},{"source":"8Hh6mIBdCt4","type":"Trailer","name":"4K Remaster Official Trailer","ytId":"8Hh6mIBdCt4","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"VujRQ8vt-m8","title":"Official English Trailer"},{"ytId":"8Hh6mIBdCt4","title":"4K Remaster Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"7.5","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0831888"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/htt